        <body>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela cijena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_plan" approved="yes"><source>Plan</source><target>Plan</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_price" approved="yes"><source>Price</source><target>Cijena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_group" approved="yes"><source>Feature group</source><target>Grupa karakteristika</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Karakteristika</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tx_pricing_domain_model_value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Vrijednost</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plugin.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela cijena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plugin.table.description" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards, comparison table or compact rows from one pricing table record.</source><target>Kartice planova, uporedna tabela ili kompaktni redovi iz jednog zapisa tabele cijena.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.general" approved="yes"><source>General</source><target>Općenito</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planovi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Karakteristike</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Cijene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.highlight" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Isticanje</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Naslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description" approved="yes"><source>Introductory note</source><target>Uvodna napomena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown above the prices in every layout, e.g. “All prices per month, plus VAT.”</source><target>Prikazuje se iznad cijena u svakom prikazu, npr. „Sve cijene su mjesečne, uvećane za PDV.“</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode" approved="yes"><source>Entered amounts are</source><target>Uneseni iznosi su</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.hint" approved="yes"><source>Defines how the entered amounts are read. Conversion only runs from net to gross, never the other way round.</source><target>Definira kako se uneseni iznosi tumače. Konverzija se vrši samo iz neto u bruto, nikada obrnuto.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.net" approved="yes"><source>Net prices</source><target>Neto cijene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Bruto cijene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Poreska stopa u postocima</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Osnova za bruto prikaz. 0 preskače konverziju.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Posjetitelji mogu birati između neto i bruto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Ako nije označeno, stranica prikazuje samo gore odabranu opciju.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Promjena valute</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>Prebacivanje se pojavljuje samo ako je za planove uneseno više valuta.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Promjena obračunskog perioda</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one period is entered for the plans.</source><target>Prebacivanje se pojavljuje samo ako je za planove uneseno više perioda.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition" approved="yes"><source>Currency symbol</source><target>Simbol valute</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.hint" approved="yes"><source>English usually puts it before the amount (“€ 99”), German and most continental European languages after it (“99 €”).</source><target>Engleski ga obično stavlja ispred iznosa („€ 99“), njemački i većina kontinentalnih evropskih jezika iza njega („99 €“).</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.before" approved="yes"><source>before the amount (€ 99)</source><target>ispred iznosa (€ 99)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.after" approved="yes"><source>after the amount (99 €)</source><target>iza iznosa (99 €)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Button label</source><target>Oznaka dugmeta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to all plans without a label of their own. Empty means “Select”.</source><target>Primjenjuje se na sve planove bez vlastite oznake. Prazno znači „Odaberite“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Select</source><target>Odaberite</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planovi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups" approved="yes"><source>Feature groups</source><target>Grupe karakteristika</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features belong to the table, not to a single plan — that is the only way the comparison table compares like with like.</source><target>Karakteristike pripadaju tabeli, a ne pojedinačnom planu — to je jedini način da uporedna tabela upoređuje isto sa istim.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.title" approved="yes"><source>Name</source><target>Naziv</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle" approved="yes"><source>Subtitle</source><target>Podnaslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle.hint" approved="yes"><source>One line below the name, e.g. “6 job ads for 30 days each”.</source><target>Jedan red ispod naziva, npr. „6 oglasa za posao u trajanju od 30 dana svaki“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow" approved="yes"><source>Eyebrow</source><target>Nadnaslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow.hint" approved="yes"><source>Small line above the name, e.g. “48 resources included”.</source><target>Mala linija iznad naziva, npr. „48 uključenih resursa“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.description" approved="yes"><source>Description</source><target>Opis</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Istaknuto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite.hint" approved="yes"><source>The plan gets a border and shadow in the accent colour, and a tinted column in the comparison table.</source><target>Plan dobija okvir i sjenku u akcentnoj boji, te zasjenjenu kolonu u uporednoj tabeli.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge" approved="yes"><source>Badge text</source><target>Tekst značke</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty omits the badge. Common are “Popular” or “Recommended”.</source><target>Prazno izostavlja značku. Uobičajeno je „Popularno“ ili „Preporučeno“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Popular</source><target>Popularan</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink" approved="yes"><source>Select button target</source><target>Odredište dugmeta za odabir</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink.hint" approved="yes"><source>Without a link no button is rendered — neither an empty one nor a placeholder.</source><target>Bez linka dugme se ne prikazuje — ni prazno ni rezervisano mjesto.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own label</source><target>Vlastita oznaka</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Overrides the label from the pricing table, for this plan only.</source><target>Poništava oznaku iz tabele cijena, samo za ovaj plan.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote" approved="yes"><source>Note below the price</source><target>Napomena ispod cijene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “billed annually” or “excl. VAT”.</source><target>Npr. „godišnja naplata“ ili „bez PDV-a“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Cijene</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues" approved="yes"><source>Feature values</source><target>Vrijednosti karakteristika</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features without a value count as not included and show a dash. Not every cell has to be filled.</source><target>Karakteristike bez vrijednosti smatraju se neuključenim i prikazuju crticu. Ne mora svaka ćelija biti popunjena.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.currency" approved="yes"><source>Currency</source><target>Valuta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period" approved="yes"><source>Period</source><target>Period</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.month" approved="yes"><source>per month</source><target>mjesečno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.year" approved="yes"><source>per year</source><target>godišnje</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.once" approved="yes"><source>one-time</source><target>jednokratno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.custom" approved="yes"><source>custom</source><target>prilagođeno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own unit</source><target>Vlastita jedinica</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “per ad” or “per calendar”.</source><target>Npr. „po oglasu“ ili „po kalendaru“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.amount" approved="yes"><source>Amount</source><target>Iznos</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequest" approved="yes"><source>Price on request</source><target>Cijena na upit</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel" approved="yes"><source>Text instead of the amount</source><target>Tekst umjesto iznosa</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty means “Price on request”.</source><target>Prazno znači „Cijena na upit“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Naslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Raspored</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>A checklist for yes/no features, value pairs for details such as fees or quotas.</source><target>Kontrolna lista za da/ne karakteristike, parovi vrijednosti za detalje poput naknada ili kvota.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.list" approved="yes"><source>Checklist</source><target>Kontrolna lista</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.pairs" approved="yes"><source>Value pairs</source><target>Parovi vrijednosti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard" approved="yes"><source>Show on cards</source><target>Prikaži na karticama</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard.hint" approved="yes"><source>Some groups belong in the comparison table only and would overload the card.</source><target>Neke grupe pripadaju samo uporednoj tabeli i preopteretile bi karticu.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Show in comparison table</source><target>Prikaži u uporednoj tabeli</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the group is left out of the comparison table.</source><target>Ako nije označeno, grupa se izostavlja iz uporedne tabele.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Karakteristike</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Naslov</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType" approved="yes"><source>Value type</source><target>Tip vrijednosti</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.hint" approved="yes"><source>Determines how the cell looks in the comparison table.</source><target>Određuje kako ćelija izgleda u uporednoj tabeli.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.check" approved="yes"><source>Check or dash</source><target>Kvačica ili crtica</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.number" approved="yes"><source>Number</source><target>Broj</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.text" approved="yes"><source>Text</source><target>Tekst</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.percent" approved="yes"><source>Percent</source><target>Procenat</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit" approved="yes"><source>Unit</source><target>Jedinica</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown after the value, e.g. “GB” or “users”.</source><target>Prikazuje se nakon vrijednosti, npr. „GB“ ili „korisnici“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote" approved="yes"><source>Footnote</source><target>Fusnota</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown in small print after the title in the comparison table.</source><target>Prikazuje se sitnim slovima nakon naslova u uporednoj tabeli.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Karakteristika</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included" approved="yes"><source>Included</source><target>Uključeno</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to features of the type “Check or dash”.</source><target>Primjenjuje se na karakteristike tipa „Kvačica ili crtica“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Vrijednost</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value.hint" approved="yes"><source>For number, text and percent. E.g. “unlimited”, “up to 48” or “2.1”.</source><target>Za broj, tekst i procenat. Npr. „neograničeno“, „do 48“ ili „2.1“.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.sheet" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela cijena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Tabela cijena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table.hint" approved="yes"><source>The record holding plans and features. The same table can appear on several pages in different layouts.</source><target>Zapis koji sadrži planove i karakteristike. Ista tabela može se pojaviti na više stranica u različitim rasporedima.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Raspored</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Kartice planova za nekoliko planova, kompaktni redovi od otprilike pet, uporedna tabela za mnogo karakteristika.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Kartice planova</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Uporedna tabela</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.groups" approved="yes"><source>Cards with feature groups</source><target>Kartice sa grupama karakteristika</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.rows" approved="yes"><source>Compact rows</source><target>Kompaktni redovi</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.accordion" approved="yes"><source>Cards with expandable details</source><target>Kartice sa proširivim detaljima</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Također prikaži uporednu tabelu</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>Uporedna tabela se tada pojavljuje ispod odabranog rasporeda.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Uporedna tabela skupljena</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>Uporedna tabela se otvara samo klikom — održava stranicu preglednom s mnogo karakteristika.</target></trans-unit>
